1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,950
Empezamos en África Occidental,

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:02,790
en Senegal:

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,890
el yassa, el plato nacional,

4
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,090
salado y ácido,

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,250
pollo marinado en limón y cebolla que se

6
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,230
sirve con arroz.

7
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,750
Subimos al norte de Europa,

8
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:11,570
a Suecia:

9
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:14,390
el gravlax, salmón crudo curado con sal y

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,970
eneldo, salado y fresco,

11
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,670
que se come con galletas y verduras encurtidas.

12
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,990
Bajamos al Cáucaso,

13
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:20,730
a Armenia:

14
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,890
el lula kebab,

15
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,170
salado y jugoso,

16
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:25,570
cordero picado con cebolla a la parrilla,

17
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,470
con lavash, cebolla y sumac.

18
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,330
Viajamos a África Oriental,

19
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,010
a Kenia:

20
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,150
el nyama choma,

21
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,470
salado y sencillo,

22
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,090
cabra o vaca a las brasas,

23
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,530
con ugali y kachumbari.

24
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,270
Cruzamos el océano hasta Nepal:

25
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:38,990
el fuchka, salado,

26
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,130
ácido y crocante,

27
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,690
una bolita hueca rellena de agua especiada,

28
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:44,110
tamarindo y garbanzos.

29
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,550
Y terminamos en Camboya:

30
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,550
el bok l'hong,

31
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,810
una ensalada de papaya verde machacada,

32
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,890
ácida y salada,

33
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,650
con arroz y pollo a la parrilla.

